cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Checkers endgame tablebase: all positions with four pieces or fewer, solved exactly"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it."
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A complete endgame tablebase for American checkers (English draughts):
  6,408,836 positions with four pieces or fewer, each with an exact result
  (win, loss or draw) and an exact distance to the end in plies. The longest
  forced win takes 109 plies. Distributed as a single byte array, one byte per
  slot, 1.82 MB gzipped, with a dependency-free Python reader and a full
  specification of the indexing scheme.
authors:
  - name: "Checkers Arena"
    website: "https://checkersarena.io/"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23002848"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pixel4youcorp/checkers-endgame-tablebase"
url: "https://checkersarena.io/checkers-endgame/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-09-27"
version: "1.0.0"
identifiers:
